WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.496
- Noah!
- Hi!

00:00:01.496 --> 00:00:02.967
- This is such a big deal you're here.

00:00:02.967 --> 00:00:05.990
- Thank you, thank you, I big deal.

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:09.780
- I mean, you are really
like such a hot shot.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:10.850
Like, I don't know--
- Oh, you too.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:12.260
- If it's "Stranger Things."

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.480
Oh, God, I'm tryin'.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.810
I don't know if it's like the TikTok world

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:17.708
is freaking out that you're here.

00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:20.411
- I don't know.
- The "Stranger Things" world.

00:00:20.411 --> 00:00:23.970
And I am so exited for "Hubie Halloween."

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:25.307
Adam was here yesterday--
- Me too, yeah.

00:00:25.307 --> 00:00:26.811
That's awesome, I love Adam.

00:00:26.811 --> 00:00:30.247
He is just the best person.
- Yeah.

00:00:30.247 --> 00:00:32.340
- Yah know, what you see is what you get.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.500
- He's pretty great, he's hilarious too.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.310
- He's such a kind and dear--
- He's so sweet.

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:39.650
I mean, just being on set with him,

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:41.570
he's like hilarious to be around.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:44.680
I remember one night
we were like exhausted,

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:46.170
and everyone just wanted to go home.

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:47.700
And he like, brought his speaker out.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.340
He started playing like Selena Gomez

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:52.070
and he just lifted the mood.

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.527
He has that effect.

00:00:53.527 --> 00:00:55.670
- How old were you when you started?

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:57.240
- Started acting?
- Yeah.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.903
- I was, oh my, I was like six or eight.

00:00:59.903 --> 00:01:01.430
(Drew gasps)
I was young.

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.650
- So you were six, I
was six when I did E.T.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:05.960
with Stephen Spielberg,

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:06.851
who you worked with--
- That's crazy.

00:01:06.851 --> 00:01:10.440
I worked, that was the
first movie I ever did.

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:12.200
I was turning 10 on set.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.090
I didn't even know who
they were at the time,

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:15.255
which is crazy to me!

00:01:15.255 --> 00:01:16.850
'Cause they were like my idols.

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:21.850
And I mean yeah, I remember
them like bringing me out

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:23.500
and surprising me with a cake on

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.167
my 10th birthday at like midnight.

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:27.750
And my mom has a video on her phone.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:29.800
It was pretty cool, so--
- So in some ways

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:33.542
both of us are very transformed
through Stephen Spielberg.

00:01:33.542 --> 00:01:35.720
- Yeah, he's like our,
he's our middle man.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.170
- Yes, he is!

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:39.450
And I, you know, my mom put me to work

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.590
when I was like in
diapers, at 11 months old.

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:43.160
- Oh my God.
- And I have to say,

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.260
I thank her every single day for it.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.340
Because I love my life,

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.440
and I love the opportunities that I have.

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.360
and it's like mine--
- Me too.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:51.820
- To screw up or not, you know?

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.080
- Yeah.
- But she gave

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.580
me a window and a door.

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:59.640
And I loved getting to be a kid that got

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.460
to live out their fantasies and dreams.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:05.690
- Yeah, oh my God, it's like
a dream, this kind of life.

00:02:05.690 --> 00:02:07.100
It's so cool.
- Can I talk to you

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.880
quickly about TikTok?

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:09.750
Because--
- Let's do it.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.740
- Okay, 13 million followers.

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:14.030
- It's crazy.

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:16.565
I joined TikTok kinda like a year ago.

00:02:16.565 --> 00:02:18.070
And it was just for fun.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.870
And then I fell in love with it.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:20.950
And sometimes I go out.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.450
And like before TikTok, obviously,

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:24.230
everyone's like, "Oh,
Stranger Things," Noah."

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:27.917
Like, "That's you," and now
the younger kids will be like,

00:02:27.917 --> 00:02:29.515
"Oh my God, Noah from TikTok!"

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:32.439
And it sits so weird to
me, like that's crazy.

00:02:32.439 --> 00:02:34.560
But it's awesome and I love it.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:37.310
- Now I'm, you know, a
parent to two daughters,

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:40.013
six and eight, and they live for TikTok.

00:02:40.013 --> 00:02:42.360
- Yeah, that's that TikTok generation.

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:43.751
- I know, they really hook 'em.

00:02:43.751 --> 00:02:45.720
- I mean, what do you think parents

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.020
should know about TikTok?

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.360
- I think it's my favorite one out of all

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:50.400
of the like socia medias.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.285
I don't know, I feel like
a lot of them can be toxic.

00:02:52.285 --> 00:02:55.740
And just not good for your
mental health, I guess.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:59.219
And TikTok's kind of just
a relaxed, fun place to be.

00:02:59.219 --> 00:03:03.610
- I'm so, like, happy that you came here.

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:05.478
I feel so lucky.
- Oh, thank you.

00:03:05.478 --> 00:03:09.530
- You really are out there in the world.

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:11.146
And there's a lot of people that watch

00:03:11.146 --> 00:03:13.010
all the things that you do.

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:15.170
You're a part of these really big worlds.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.130
Like, "Stranger Things,"

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:16.963
and TikTok--
- You're so nice.

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:17.920
- And--
- So many compliments.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.390
- It's true though.
- Thank you.

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:21.713
- Like, it's you know,
when you're that out there,

00:03:21.713 --> 00:03:23.700
and you're reaching that many people,

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:26.847
it's always nice when it's
a really nice person too.

00:03:26.847 --> 00:03:27.960
You know?
- Aw.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:29.430
- Because--
- Well, same with you.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:32.150
I mean, you're so influential,
and you're so grounded.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.410
And this is just
compliments back and forth.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:37.447
- By the way, it was a
winding road to get here.

00:03:37.447 --> 00:03:39.320
And that's why I'm so
- Oh I know.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:40.570
- Invested, you know?

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.590
Because nobody has a straight path.

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.927
We all have to figure out who
we're gonna be in this world.

00:03:44.927 --> 00:03:48.359
And when we see, you know,
people leading a good life,

00:03:48.359 --> 00:03:53.120
who other kids are looking
to, parents are look to.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.970
It's like good, you're safe, you're good,

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:58.800
you are kind, you are talented,
and I'm so glad you're here.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:03:59.633
- Thank you.
- Thank you, Noah,

00:03:59.633 --> 00:04:00.466
for visiting the show.
- Thank you so much

00:04:00.466 --> 00:04:01.390
for having me.
(audience applauds)

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.380
Thank you.
- Seriously, I can't wait

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:07.340
to see the big next epic
thing you step into.

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:09.211
- Thank you, thank you--
- Well, we're cheering you on.

00:04:09.211 --> 00:04:10.220
- Thank you so much, you're the best--

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.410
- Thank you Noah.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:14.870
All right, "Hubie Halloween"
is available on Netflix now.

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:15.759
Say that with a lisp.

